{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n \\\"遮挡|occlusion|depth legend|line segment|交叉\\\" /home/lixinyu/snap -g '*.py' -g '*.json'\"","aggregated_output":"/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_7666fa5d_20260502_042707/report.json:764:    \"description\": \"网格中同时包含反对角线段和主对角线段，线段以网格中心为对称点成对出现。填充由对称配对的线段之间的空间决定，同方向的对称线段对之间按原规则填充，不同方向的线段交叉处形成特殊图案。解题者需发现中心对称结构和方向分类规则。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/668eec9a.json:3:  \"src\": \"same-color foreground line segments on the background\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/audit_combo_2b83f449.json:222:    \"name\": \"全行令牌+路径交叉检测\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/88bcf3b4.json:2:  \"summary\": \"An irregular line segment connected to the terminal of a vertical/horizontal bar perpendicular to grid edge wraps around a nearby obstacle sprite and repositions while preserving total pixel count.\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/88bcf3b4.json:4:  \"src\": \"irregular line segment attached to terminal of edge-perpendicular bar s\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/audit_a32d8b75.json:174:    \"variant_name\": \"双标记交叉定位：行和列分别由两个独立标记编码\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/audit_a32d8b75.json:210:    \"variant_name\": \"精灵间遮挡顺序由图例位置决定\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_7b80bb43_20260502_052324/report.json:285:    \"description\": \"输入中间隙两侧各有一个L形对角提示（形成镜像对称），L的朝向指示间隙所在的线段方向（水平/垂直），L的臂长指示间隙到交叉点的距离。输出为填充间隙、删除L形提示后的干净网络。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_7b80bb43_20260502_052324/report.json:423:    \"description\": \"输入为完全独立（无交叉）的线段集合，每条线段两端都锚定到网格边缘。间隙出现在线段中部，对角提示标记间隙位置。输出为修复后的锚定独立线段集。推理简化了拓扑但增加了边缘锚定约束的验证。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/b0f4d537.py:102:    - The other panel is a compact colored prototype made from horizontal and vertical line segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/b0f4d537.py:111:    - The yellow pixels are anchors for the prototype's graph vertices, while the compact prototype supplies the colors for the stretched line segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a6f40cea_20260503_merged/report.json:567:    \"description\": \"多条路径从各自触点出发延伸，碰到另一条已有路径时停止。碰撞/交叉点像素变为第三种颜色。解题者需推断碰撞停止规则和碰撞点特殊着色规则。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a6f40cea_20260503_merged/report.json:1466:    \"description\": \"4-6个组件的路径密集交错，交叉点像素变为第三种颜色。大量组件使交叉频繁发生，输出呈现复杂多色交叉图案。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/review_pack_1ae2feb7.json:3293:    \"description\": \"反转处理顺序：先处理距分隔条最远的色条，后处理最近的。由于no-overwrite规则，最近的色条反而被远处色条的涂点遮挡。这完全反转了优先级逻辑，解题者需要注意远优先的非直觉规则。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/review_pack_1ae2feb7.json:4241:    \"description\": \"网格中有两条垂直分隔线，将网格分为三个区域：两侧为色条区域，中间为涂色目标区域。两侧的色条分别向中间区域延伸射线，在中间产生更复杂的交叉涂色模式。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_4c7dc4dd_20260506_103922/report.json:856:    \"description\": \"提供两个训练对展示同一规则（不同颜色），但被刻意设计为可能匹配多种规则。解题者需利用第二个训练对交叉验证消歧。最终将变换结果填入空白框架并输出整个网格。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_16de56c4_20260505_112011/report.json:1970:    \"description\": \"一行有多种标记色各自定义射线，多条射线在同一位置交叉时按颜色优先级决定最终颜色。解题者需识别多条射线并从样例推导颜色优先级排序。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/16de56c4.json:6:  \"dst\": \"fill the line segment between extreme occurrences (or whole line if no companion color)\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/b7999b51.py:144:    \"\"\"Reject attempts whose occlusion changed the intended solver output.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/audit_269e22fb.json:90:    \"variant_name\": \"带遮挡的裁剪窗口\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/final_audit_3e6067c3.json:424:    \"variant_name\": \"桥梁交叉时后者覆盖前者\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/final_audit_3e6067c3.json:435:    \"variant_name\": \"交叉点使用混合色\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_64efde09_20260506_220547/report.json:488:    \"name\": \"面对面射线交叉混合\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_64efde09_20260506_220547/report.json:490:    \"description\": \"精灵两两活跃边面对面放置射线必然交叉，交叉点用混合规则着色。解题者需理解对称布局产生的碰撞模式并推断混合规则。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_64efde09_20260506_220547/report.json:830:    \"name\": \"交叉标记+链式反应\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_64efde09_20260506_220547/report.json:834:    \"description\": \"标记放在非关联精灵方向上（标记A标注精灵B），射线命中后链式传播。需先解开交叉映射关系再追踪多轮传播。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/audit_combo_80a900e0.json:150:    \"name\": \"密集交叉标记\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/audit_combo_80a900e0.json:210:    \"name\": \"反射交叉标记\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_269e22fb_20260506_082854/report.json:1121:    \"name\": \"三色部分可见遮挡匹配\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_269e22fb_20260506_082854/report.json:1126:    \"description\": \"输入使用三种颜色：前景、背景、未知/遮挡。既有块状遮挡区域又有散布未知像素，信息缺失模式更复杂。解题者仅用已知像素进行部分信息匹配。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_89565ca0_20260507_052240/report.json:1867:    \"description\": \"重叠区显示标记色，分两步处理：先还原被遮挡墙壁，再计数房间。标记色提供显式线索。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/variant_meta_3e6067c3.json:194:    \"alt_name\": \"桥梁交叉时后者覆盖前者\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/variant_meta_3e6067c3.json:195:    \"desc\": \"当两段桥梁在空间上交叉时，后绘制的桥梁覆盖先绘制的桥梁像素。处理顺序直接影响视觉结果，增加了对执行顺序的推理要求\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/variant_meta_3e6067c3.json:199:    \"alt_name\": \"交叉点使用混合色\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/variant_meta_3e6067c3.json:200:    \"desc\": \"当两段桥梁交叉时，交叉像素使用两种桥梁颜色之外的第三种特殊颜色标记。需要理解碰撞检测逻辑\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_581f7754_20260506_113449/report.json:573:    \"description\": \"锚点为网格内部穿过整行/列的彩色十字线，精灵沿十字线滑动使标记对齐到交叉点。输出裁切为十字线附近的窄条带区域。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a47bf94d_20260503_054255/report.json:6:    \"name\": \"BFS激活+反射交叉\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a47bf94d_20260503_054255/report.json:76:    \"name\": \"方向标记引导+颜色编码交叉\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a47bf94d_20260503_054255/report.json:81:    \"description\": \"管道交叉处用不同颜色的箭头像素指示转向方向作为默认规则，同时交叉标记颜色（red/blue）决定在该交叉处是直行还是转弯。当两种规则冲突时，颜色编码优先。解题者需学习两层路由规则及其优先级关系。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a47bf94d_20260503_054255/report.json:970:    \"description\": \"交叉处移除大部分标记（默认直行优先规则），但保留少量偏移放置的标记（距交叉2-3格而非1格）用于指示需要转弯的位置。解题者需先发现偏移标记的存在，再理解其含义。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a47bf94d_20260503_054255/report.json:1108:    \"description\": \"传输轨迹每隔N格涂一个token色像素（虚线状），管道本身按段交替使用两种颜色（每经过一个交叉切换颜色）。轨迹间距N等于当前管道段的颜色交替计数。解题者需发现两种周期性模式的关联。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a47bf94d_20260503_054255/report.json:1242:    \"description\": \"Token分布在网格左右两侧，管道横向连接。互补形状传输距离等于可推断参数（如源token像素数或管道交叉数），不一定传到最远端。左右布局使水平传输距离成为核心变量。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a47bf94d_20260503_054255/report.json:1447:    \"description\": \"交叉处仅单侧有标记（左侧=左转，右侧=右转），网格中存在不连通的假管道段，交叉点标记数量编码行为（1个=直行，3个=转弯）。解题者需忽略假管道，从标记位置和数量推断交叉行为。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a47bf94d_20260503_054255/report.json:1785:    \"name\": \"最短路径+反射交叉+旋转节点+多标记编码\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a47bf94d_20260503_054255/report.json:1790:    \"description\": \"无预建管道，信号BFS搜索最短路径。交叉处反射改变方向，经过color-9矩形块旋转形状，交叉标记数量编码行为（1=直行，3=转弯）。解题者需综合四种规则确定路由和最终形状。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/make_7b3084d4_variants.py:25:    (\"D8\", \"2\"): (\"D8 — 拼图块分割方式（tab结构） (meta)\", \"交叉分割（十字形）\", \"cross5\"),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_53fb4810_20260506_103138/report.json:2666:    \"description\": \"射线沿对角线投射，每个精灵有多个标记（多条对角射线），且精灵在输出中消失。输出为多条对角线条带交叉的图案。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/de493100.py:72:    - The rectangle is an occlusion mask, not an object to preserve; the answer is the missing crop of the virtual mirror pattern.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_195c6913_20260506_042805/report.json:774:    \"name\": \"粒子相遇停止+轨迹允许交叉+碰撞后发射新粒子\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_195c6913_20260506_042805/report.json:780:    \"description\": \"两个粒子同时模拟，轨迹允许交叉（后到覆盖先到的颜色）；粒子碰撞停止后从停止位置发射新粒子继续前进（链式反应）；当两个粒子的轨迹相遇时双双停止。初始两粒子各自前进+转弯，碰壁停止后发射子粒子继续行走，但当任何两个活跃粒子相遇时全部停止。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_195c6913_20260506_042805/report.json:1535:    \"name\": \"轨迹允许交叉+无分隔条\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_195c6913_20260506_042805/report.json:1539:    \"description\": \"移除bg分隔条，两个标记的path区域完全重叠；轨迹允许交叉，后到的粒子覆盖先到的颜色。组合效果：path空间共享自然需要交叉规则来处理重叠——输出中轨迹交叉区域显示后模拟标记的颜色。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_195c6913_20260506_042805/report.json:1678:    \"description\": \"path为横竖交叉的网格结构（十字路口），粒子在走廊中跟随行走（而非直线到碰撞），在网格的某处放置特定颜色目标像素，粒子到达目标时停止。组合效果：网格状path提供多条可行路线，走廊跟随使粒子在十字路口处选择方向，目标像素定义终点——形成\\\"迷宫寻路\\\"主题。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/c6e1b8da.py:81:    - A thin tail is a displacement vector for its rectangle, while wider missing areas inside another color's bounding box are occlusion that should be restored.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_5dbc8537_20260506_215935/report.json:1181:    \"description\": \"精灵间距编码填充优先级，精灵按面积排序与洞对比。两种排序形成交叉验证机制或互相消歧。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_0934a4d8_20260506_043545/report.json:148:    \"description\": \"网格中有2-3个独立小矩形标记（同色），分别恢复每个被遮挡区域后按位置顺序紧凑排列成一行输出，用分隔色隔开。解题者需同时理解多标记恢复和输出拼合规则。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_0934a4d8_20260506_043545/report.json:703:    \"description\": \"网格由嵌套的同心矩形环构成图案，具有C4旋转对称性。标记遮挡部分环结构，解题者需识别旋转对称和环形纹理规律，利用旋转轨道恢复被遮挡的环片段。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_0934a4d8_20260506_043545/report.json:1326:    \"description\": \"网格具有C4旋转对称性，标记覆盖旋转中心，恢复通过180度点对称。标记覆盖中心时180度对也被遮挡，需利用C4的90度信息恢复。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_0934a4d8_20260506_043545/report.json:1465:    \"description\": \"输出整个修复后网格，但网格中存在设计上的局部对称性破缺。解题者需区分标记遮挡和设计破缺，仅修复标记区域，保留设计破缺不变。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/4aab4007.py:16:    \"\"\"Fill the black occlusions by continuing the visible framed anti-diagonal color table.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/ca8f78db.py:47:    The visible cells still include every residue of the repeating tile, so the black pixels are occlusions rather than objects to preserve.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/ca8f78db.py:117:def _place_occlusion_mask():\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/ca8f78db.py:141:    covered = _place_occlusion_mask()\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a32d8b75_20260502_205647/report.json:570:    \"description\": \"位置标记像素在NxN方块中的位置直接映射为画布上的比例偏移（连续定位），同时锚点不使用标记方块而是由画布背景中嵌入的特殊标记像素指示放置位置。两种定位信息需要交叉验证或联合使用。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a32d8b75_20260502_205647/report.json:1972:    \"description\": \"背景使用对角线条纹（45度/135度斜纹），复合精灵经旋转+翻转后放置。斜纹背景与旋转后的精灵方向产生视觉干涉效果——不同旋转角度下精灵与背景的对角纹理可能平行或交叉，增加视觉辨识挑战。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_80a900e0_20260502_074614/report.json:834:    \"name\": \"密集交叉标记\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_80a900e0_20260502_074614/report.json:836:    \"description\": \"网格中有4-6个菱形（高密度），射线交叉处使用第三种颜色标记。多菱形产生大量射线，频繁交叉生成许多特殊标记点，形成复杂的交叉图案。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_80a900e0_20260502_074614/report.json:1177:    \"name\": \"反射交叉标记\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_80a900e0_20260502_074614/report.json:1179:    \"description\": \"射线遇障碍物反弹继续传播（反射），且不同射线交叉处使用第三种颜色标记。反射路径更长更复杂，交叉点更多，标记点形成不规则分布。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_80a900e0_20260502_074614/report.json:1875:    \"description\": \"菱形尺寸可变（3x3到7x7），每个菱形4条边都有外边框（全覆盖）。大菱形有更长的外边框和更多像素，4方向全辐射产生对称的十字交叉射线模式。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/f823c43c.py:43:    The pink pixels are occlusions in a global periodic tile, not independent objects.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_71e489b6_20260507_030631/report.json:709:    \"description\": \"只检测1像素大小的缺陷，且只标记位于蓝黑边界上的缺陷（至少有1个蓝色和1个黑色4邻居）。交叉约束定义特殊目标。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a6f40cea_20260503_070310/report.json:567:    \"description\": \"多条路径从各自触点出发延伸，碰到另一条已有路径时停止。碰撞/交叉点像素变为第三种颜色。解题者需推断碰撞停止规则和碰撞点特殊着色规则。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a6f40cea_20260503_070310/report.json:1466:    \"description\": \"4-6个组件的路径密集交错，交叉点像素变为第三种颜色。大量组件使交叉频繁发生，输出呈现复杂多色交叉图案。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_6ffbe589_20260507_030619/report.json:1457:    \"description\": \"固定模板形状精灵配合画布边缘图例区域。双渠道信息编码，需交叉验证。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/arc-agi-2-eval-annotations-merge.json:303:    \"dst\": \"fill the line segment between extreme occurrences (or whole line if no companion color)\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/arc-agi-2-eval-annotations-merge.json:1111:    \"summary\": \"An irregular line segment connected to the terminal of a vertical/horizontal bar perpendicular to grid edge wraps around a nearby obstacle sprite and repositions while preserving total pixel count.\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/arc-agi-2-eval-annotations-merge.json:1113:    \"src\": \"irregular line segment attached to terminal of edge-perpendicular bar s\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tem/eee78d87_parent_retest.json:5199:    \"name\": \"栗色交叉处显示+背景色由字形色决定\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/e376de54.py:42:    Align parallel colored line segments so they all share the same start and end positions as a reference line.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/e376de54.py:46:    - Several parallel line segments (diagonal, horizontal, or vertical), each a different color, running in the same direction but starting/ending at different positions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/7666fa5d.py:13:    Fill the parallelogram-shaped region between parallel anti-diagonal line segments with red.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/ded97339.py:19:    - The markers define all orthogonal line segments by row/column alignment; spans are computed from the input markers, not from newly drawn pixels.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/484b58aa.py:64:    The occlusions hide a repeated lattice, and the strongest self-translation of\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/41e4d17e.py:7:# non-black background, occlusion\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2d0172a1/18/code.py:34:#   bbox 选父节点时假设最小包含 frame 就是直接父节点；generator 保证 frame 只做真嵌套，不制造交叉或共享 bbox 的歧义结构。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/f9012d9b.py:7:# symmetry detection, occlusion\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/f9012d9b.py:24:    - Treat black cells as the occlusion mask.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/f9012d9b.py:40:    occlusion_color = Color.BLACK\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/f9012d9b.py:41:    black_rectangle_mask = (input_grid == occlusion_color)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/f9012d9b.py:43:    # Find the symmetry. Notice that black is not the background, but instead is the occlusion color. In fact there is no well-defined background color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/f9012d9b.py:44:    symmetries = detect_translational_symmetry(input_grid, ignore_colors=[occlusion_color], background=None)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/f9012d9b.py:49:            if int(input_grid[sym_r, sym_c]) != occlusion_color:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/f9012d9b.py:55:    filled_in_region = np.full_like(input_grid, occlusion_color)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/f9012d9b.py:58:    b = bbox(filled_in_region != occlusion_color)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/f9012d9b.py:72:    # Make a random sprite with NO black pixels (so the occlusion is unambiguous).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/80a900e0.py:75:    - Short diagonal line segments in another non-bg color adjacent to each diamond edge (outer border).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/db695cfb_parent_review.json:2300:      \"variant_name\": \"交叉点使用特殊颜色\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/db695cfb_parent_review.json:2301:      \"prompt_variant_name\": \"交叉点使用特殊颜色\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/db695cfb_parent_review.json:2382:      \"variant_name\": \"交叉时两条线都中断\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/db695cfb_parent_review.json:2383:      \"prompt_variant_name\": \"交叉时两条线都中断\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/a47bf94d_parent_review.json:399:      \"variant_name\": \"无标记交叉——优先级规则\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/a47bf94d_parent_review.json:479:      \"variant_name\": \"颜色编码交叉行为\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/a47bf94d_parent_review.json:480:      \"prompt_variant_name\": \"颜色编码交叉行为\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/a47bf94d_parent_review.json:2533:      \"variant_name\": \"恒等置换（无交叉）\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/a47bf94d_parent_review.json:2534:      \"prompt_variant_name\": \"恒等置换（无交叉）\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/de809cff.py:155:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/db3e9e38.py:22:    - The input contains one non-black line segment on a black background.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2d0172a1/15/code.py:395:    Clean a rough nested multi-color drawing with depth legend pixels into a canonical frame-and-dot diagram.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/11852cab.py:8:# symmetry detection, occlusion\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88bcf3b4.py:230:    Swing an irregular line segment around a nearby obstacle sprite, preserving its pixel count.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/40853293.py:52:    - The sparse input pixels are endpoints of colored line segments; segment orientation, not color id order, resolves crossings.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/0dfd9992.py:8:# occlusion, translational symmetry\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/0dfd9992.py:16:    Restore black occlusions in a translationally periodic pattern using matching orbit colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/cf98881b.py:7:# occlusion\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/cf98881b.py:29:    - Panel order encodes occlusion: blue is back, maroon is middle, and yellow is front.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/3345333e.py:8:# symmetry, occlusion\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/6aa20dc0.py:125:        # Additional random occlusion.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/22425bda.py:161:    \"\"\"Return parameters whose line has enough raw cells before occlusion.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/22425bda.py:239:    \"\"\"Enumerate Hamiltonian orders that respect bottom-to-top occlusions.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/1/code.py:27:#      目标中心色则用这两个源精灵的 border 色交叉填入，避免与融合匹配重合。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/1/code.py:60:#      的重复线索；同时目标中心色又交叉复用了两个源的边框色，保证原题反事实输出会不同。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/652646ff.py:74:        assert len(top) == 1, \"ring occlusion must determine a unique top-to-bottom order\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/652646ff.py:99:    - Topologically sort these occlusion relations from top to bottom, then draw\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/1190bc91.py:154:    \"\"\"Place the main run and cast 4 diagonal rays from each pixel (with occlusion). Returns (ray_grid, coords) or (None, None).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/38/code.py:30:#    - 三档面积分居不同区域类型: 大目标在内部/边缘，小精灵在角落，灰路径穿越中间空白，减少遮挡与层叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/26/code.py:47:#     - 输出中的四个精灵彼此分离、无遮挡、顶边对齐，便于同时观察形状类别、尺度和排序规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/668eec9a.py:34:    - Each non-background color forms one contiguous one-cell-thick line segment.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/668eec9a.py:35:    - The line segments have distinct topmost rows, and there are at most five of\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/668eec9a.py:46:    vertical order of the colored line segments is encoded in the output stack.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/668eec9a.py:56:        assert _is_line_segment(coords), \"each foreground color must be one line segment\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/668eec9a.py:59:    assert 0 < len(ordered) <= 5, \"expected one to five foreground line segments\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/668eec9a.py:61:    assert len(set(top_rows)) == len(top_rows), \"line segments must have distinct top rows\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/17/code.py:58:#    没有交叉路径，也不引入额外花哨标记。这样无边框变化和颜色匹配变化都能被肉眼稳定读出。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9385bd28/16/code.py:302:    Key insight: The short line segments are temporary edge clues, not permanent output; they reveal both the rectangle and which diagonal-oriented half to paint, then they disappear.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/5/code.py:42:#    很干净: 高位残留水和低位流入水在几何上分区明显, 不会出现多种符号互相遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/10/code.py:23:#      它与 marker 颜色是两套信息。输出时，搬入条形的非基线部分获得槽位原色，而该槽位基线交叉段\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/10/code.py:49:#      等于该槽输入时原本的颜色，而基线交叉段颜色等于搬进来的那根条的原色。主体色与基线色分离，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/9/code.py:50:#       没有叠写标记或遮挡，四个对象分布清晰。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/36/code.py:47:#    - 上层主动轨道、中层粗糙脊和底层盆地分居不同区域, 没有颜色或对象重叠遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/6cbe9eb8.py:46:        # rectangle colors have one large component, sometimes split by occlusion.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/13/code.py:49:# - 远侧预充只改变 5/7 的空间分布，不新增覆盖层，也不会让对象互相遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/78332cb0/2/code.py:63:#   - 两层变换都只在块内部重排像素，不引入遮挡，也不改变布局骨架。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/3/code.py:15:    - D4 turns every cue into a solid horizontal or vertical line segment.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/3/code.py:35:    - Cue geometry is restricted to a single clean family: solid axis-aligned line segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/3/code.py:48:    - Width decoding only makes sense if cues are true solid line segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/3/code.py:169:    assert area == length, \"expected the cue to be a solid line segment\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/3/code.py:215:    - Outside the board, some of those colors appear again as separate monochrome straight line segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/42/code.py:44:#    - 颜色只用 3 种结构色以内，蓝水与结构对比强，不会出现同一区域多种标记互相遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/8/code.py:21:#     XOR，所以双方都覆盖的交叉轮廓格会被擦回背景，只剩两侧未重合的边线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/8/code.py:43:#     - 输入里框内是彩色单像素锚点，输出里这些位置“长出”同色模板的轮廓，且相邻轮廓交叉处消失，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:3:# Name: 特殊色填充 + 裁剪输出 + 交叉处背景色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:12:#       - 标记到线色的分配、黄射线的擦除/延伸、交叉处按可见碎片度判胜，这三条原始主逻辑仍保留。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:14:#       - D14/0: 真正交叉格在输入中不再显示任一线色，而是直接留成背景色空洞。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:19:#     - 若蓝线和橙线在 (5,6) 真实交叉，则输入把 (5,6) 留空；solver 需分别补回水平/竖直两条逻辑路径，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:24:#       1) 隐藏交叉恢复后显示胜者线色；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:28:#       - 输入交叉中心已有“失败者”线色，红标记恢复后也直接变回所属线色，输出尺寸不变。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:30:#       - 同一交叉中心在输入里变成背景洞，需要从两条正交 1 格缺口共同推回。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:34:#       - 解题者不能再把“背景洞”统一解释成普通缺口，因为交叉洞和红缺口洞的输出语义不同。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:38:#     - 交叉仍限制为每格两色、且两线正交；黄射线仍禁止经过真实交叉，避免“灰色修复痕迹”和“黄射线强制胜出”叠在同一洞上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:39:#     - 生成器强制至少放 2 个红标记，并给跨越全部交叉的主线额外制造碎片，避免隐藏交叉只靠颜色 id 平局决胜。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:42:#     - `main()` 仍依赖“标记能在四向视线中看到某条可见线色”；隐藏交叉只把交叉格挖空，不破坏这点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:46:#       本组合里，生成器保证所有无黄射线的多色重叠都是真实隐藏交叉，因此 solver 可直接按碎片度判胜。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:49:#     - 交叉格始终加入 `blocked`，红/黄标记都不能占用或贴邻真实交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:50:#     - 黄候选若其目标射线穿过真实交叉则直接弃用，避免背景交叉同时承载改向语义。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:57:#     - 特殊色只承担一种语义：红缺口修复痕迹。交叉恢复仍显示线色，避免一个格子同时表达两种规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/29/code.py:58:#     - 黄射线、灰色修复痕迹、隐藏交叉三种机制被分配到不同位置约束中，减少视觉叠层。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/9/code.py:3:# Name: 保留间隙+色块遮挡+裁剪输出\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/8/code.py:241:    - The difficult part is still the original one: infer each frame's room count despite occlusion and noise. The fusion only changes the destination encoding, combining area-based N x N blocks with a transposed, bottom-anchored global layout.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/31/code.py:3:# Name: 交叉棋盘格 + 高密度多色 + 三色交叉\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8b7bacbf/24/code.py:54:#     - \"frame 仍然附着在线的外侧，且生成时尽量避开 seed 起始几步，避免中点提示被遮挡。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/24/code.py:62:#       - \"Placement enforces non-overlap and a gap, preventing occlusion-driven bbox distortion.\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/5/code.py:3:# Name: 碰撞颜色混合+交叉点特殊标记\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/5/code.py:33:#      2) 再从静态路径里提取共享格/对角几何交叉, 覆写局部混色与特殊标记.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/24/code.py:3:# Name: 三种标记颜色 + 颜色编码目标 + 三色交叉\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/50/code.py:33:# - 原 `resolve_cross_collision()` / `resolve_segment_cross_collision()` 处理几何对角交叉。为了让“空隙长度是唯一视觉差异”\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:3:# Name: 反射旧臂 + 交叉处选线段更长颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:11:#    - 这一复制出来的前缀允许穿过别色已有直线，于是会制造“输入里不存在、输出里重新出现”的交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:12:#    - 这些交叉不再由“黄色优先”或“碎片度更高者”决定，而是比较两种颜色在该格穿过的局部直线段长度；更长者显示。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:13:#    - 例：蓝线在 pivot 处向上可见 3 格，向右原本有 5 格；输入把右侧前 3 格去掉，并把第 1 格改成黄。若这 3 格中第 2 格与一条长度 2 的绿竖线相交，则输出恢复蓝色并显示蓝；若相交的是长度 6 的绿竖线，则交叉格保持绿，但蓝线在其下方被恢复。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:16:#    - 生成器强制黄色缺口前缀里至少包含一个真实交叉，并优先选择输出中该交叉会切换可见颜色的案例，让融合效果肉眼可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:17:#    - 仍维持 2-4 种线色、稀疏直角折线、二元正交交叉，避免新增对象类型。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:21:#    - 长度判胜依赖“交叉是二元、且两色在该格都有可测的直线通过”；生成器继续用输出先构造的正交交叉保证这一点，并拒绝等长 tie。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:22:#    - 反射长度测量依赖 pivot 恰是非交叉拐角，且只有一条可见垂直源臂；生成器仅从这类 turn 中选黄色候选。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:24:#    - 黄色候选要求：源臂长度 >= 2，目标臂长度严格大于源臂长度，marker 本格不是交叉，且缺口后面仍保留远端碎片。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:25:#    - 允许缺口内部出现交叉，但禁止源臂测量段本身经过交叉，避免“源长度”被别色遮挡而不可读。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:26:#    - 红标记与黄标记都避开交叉、pivot 及其邻域，保持 marker singleton 条件。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:29:#    - 同时，补回前缀中的某些交叉显示结果取决于哪条直线更长，而不是颜色编号，也不是“黄控制一定赢”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:31:#    - 反射只发生在单个拐角附近，且交叉仍是单像素二元正交交叉；没有三色堆叠或边界贴线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:32:#    - 生成器拒绝等长交叉与 marker 相邻碰撞，减少杂乱和歧义。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:34:#    - 没有隐藏颜色排序。非单色格的显示仅依赖可见几何：黄色缺口用垂直臂长度复制，交叉用局部直线段长度比较。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:37:#    - 假设：被反射恢复的交叉至少有唯一长度赢家。保证：target 渲染阶段拒绝 equal-length crossing。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/3/code.py:38:#    - 假设：若样本声明是融合样本，则至少有一个“黄色恢复前缀里的交叉”在输出中改色，且该格按旧碎片规则不会得到同样结果。保证：derive_input 显式检查这一量化条件。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/42/code.py:3:# Name: 穿过交换颜色+沿对方方向转弯+交叉点特殊标记\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/26/code.py:58:# - 轨迹都沿平行的独立行/列展开，彼此不交叉；裁剪只去掉纯背景边带，不引入额外符号。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/eee78d87/27/code.py:3:# Name: 栗色交叉处显示+背景色由字形色决定\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:3:# Name: 三种标记颜色 + 交叉处棋盘格交替\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:19:      - 两色逻辑交叉时，最终只显示一种颜色：黄色射线优先，否则按“修复前碎片度更高者胜出”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:21:      - 保留红/黄两类标记，再加入粉色单像素。粉色不只是补线，还会给其所属颜色在一整串交叉里赋予“优先色”身份。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:22:      - 但 D5/2 把“优先色全覆盖交叉”改成了“交叉格按全局棋盘格奇偶交替显示两色”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:23:      - 具体地，若交叉点坐标满足 `(r + c) % 2 == 0`，则显示该交叉的优先色；否则显示另一条穿过该点的线色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:24:      - 粉色放在一条直干道上，solver 先把它修回原线色，再沿该直干道收集所有可达交叉；这些交叉共同构成一个棋盘格交替家族。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:26:      - 例：橙线是一条竖直主干，依次与青色蛇形线在 4 个位置相交。原题会让青色因碎片更多而在 4 个交叉点全部可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:27:      - 现在若橙线主干上有一个粉色标记，solver 会先修复该粉点，再顺着橙线找到这 4 个交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:28:      - 输出不再是“4 个交叉全变橙色”，而是按坐标奇偶交替：偶格显示橙，奇格显示青，于是同一列交叉形成橙/青/橙/青 的可见节奏。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:31:    - 只保留两条逻辑线色，让“交叉处两色交替”在视觉上干净，不被第三条穿越线打乱。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:32:    - 每个样例都强制至少 3 个同家族交叉，且这些交叉沿主干按奇偶交替，避免退化成单交叉或同奇偶重复而看不出棋盘格。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:35:    - 原 solver 默认“所有非黄单像素只影响补线，不影响交叉决策”；融合后粉色还会产生交叉家族优先权，因此必须显式追踪粉色目标家族。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:36:    - 原 solver 在 `len(colors_here) > 1` 时直接选单一胜者；融合后只有真正的正交交叉才能套用棋盘格，其它纯填充重叠仍沿用原单色消歧。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:38:    - 原 pink 单变体只要求“唯一交叉”；这里改成“同一直干道上的一组交叉”，于是 `trace` 逻辑必须从收集单点改成收集整族，并假定该族只涉及同一对颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:39:    - 棋盘格决策依赖一个完全可见的空间规则 `(r+c)%2`，不依赖颜色 id；generator 因而必须保证目标交叉族里同时出现两种 parity。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:41:    - 粉色只放在会经过至少 3 个交叉的直主干上，且离最近交叉正好 2 格，中间保留 1 个同色像素，避免与交叉/端点/转角重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:42:    - 黄色仍只放在端点外侧；其旧臂与新射线都不允许碰到任何交叉族，避免“黄射线全覆盖”与“棋盘格交替”在同一点争优先级。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:43:    - 红色仍放在转角或端点，并与粉/黄以及彼此保持单像素孤立，不越界、不相邻、不覆盖交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:45:    - 输入中直接能看到三种孤立标记色：红用于普通补线，黄只出现在边界延伸方向附近，粉固定出现在靠近一串交叉的直干道上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:46:    - 输出中最显眼的新现象是：一整串交叉不再统一显示同一色，而是按网格棋盘格交替显色；粉色所在那条线恰好提供“哪一色是优先色”的局部线索。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:47:    - 由于每个样例都至少有 3 个同家族交叉，人类从 2-4 个样例里能看到重复的交替节奏，而不是把变化误读成噪声。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:49:    - 只保留两条逻辑线色，交叉家族沿一条直主干排开，避免多色多层覆盖造成的拥挤。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:50:    - 粉色家族与黄色射线强制分离；红标也不落在交叉附近，因此同一区域不会同时叠加三种新机制。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:51:    - 交叉列/行至少有 3 个点且间隔 >=2，棋盘格节奏清晰可读。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:53:    - 颜色变化不是任意映射，而是伴随固定结构线索：粉色总在某条直干道上，且该干道对应的交叉族在输出里呈交替显色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:56:    - 样本始终包含至少 1 个粉色标记，并且它追踪到的交叉家族大小 >= 3，且该家族包含两种 parity。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:58:    - 所有粉色标记都位于直线段上，沿该段可达的交叉只涉及同一对颜色；solver 的 family trace 不会遇到多义目标。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:59:    - 在这些输入上，原始 solver 会把交叉全判给碎片更高的颜色，而融合 solver 会在粉色家族上输出交替图案，因此可通过差异统计验证没有退化回原任务。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/32/code.py:30:#    - 新 solver 改为先独立追踪每条固定直线, 再统一扫描“共享格子/对角线几何交叉”并覆写碰撞色.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/136b0064/24/code.py:158:            assert row + 1 < H, \"vertical polyline segment exits bottom\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/136b0064/24/code.py:167:        assert 0 <= end_c < left_w, \"polyline segment exits side\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/17/code.py:31:#    - 仍保留原题的 2-4 条折线、交叉、碎片度裁决与 crossing 重着色, 任务没有退化成单一路径修补.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/17/code.py:54:#    - 去掉 yellow 可显著减少局部叠层; 交叉仍保留在别处, 保持原题视觉家族相似度.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/15/code.py:3:# Name: 交叉选碎片度更低颜色 + 仅2种线色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/9/code.py:73:     background, thin colored walls, overlap occlusion, and one noise color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/25/code.py:29:#       的控制色，再分别数红色块数，最后执行交叉映射：输出高度=右上红块数=3，输出宽度=左上红块数=5。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/10/code.py:26:#       difference: \"Bar lengths encode room counts exactly as before, but row order is now spatial and the input no longer contains any occlusion clues.\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/10/code.py:40:#       - \"Frames are placed with non-overlapping bboxes and a clear gap, so no center estimate is corrupted by occlusion.\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/16/code.py:3:# Name: T形分叉节点 + 交叉处显示混合标记色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/21/code.py:33:#   ordinary black background; tie handling changes from occlusion order to position.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/21/code.py:231:    - There is no extra noise color and no inter-object occlusion, so every shell is fully visible.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/9/code.py:3:# Name: 全局最优标记匹配 + 不要求所有线色参与交叉\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/9/code.py:11:#    - D11/1 去掉“每种线色都必须参与交叉”的旧约束后, 右侧或下侧可以出现完全独立的折线颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/9/code.py:12:#      这些颜色也能承载红标记, 因而全局匹配不能再依赖“每色都会在交叉处被别的颜色再次确认”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/9/code.py:19:#      4. 若这条蓝线还是“不参与任何交叉”的独立颜色, 旧的“所有颜色都在交叉里验证一次”隐式前提就\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/9/code.py:22:#    - 仍保留 4 条线色、至少 1 处交叉、红标记主导的缺口修补, 视觉复杂度与原题接近。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/9/code.py:24:#      来自无交叉颜色。这样 2-4 组样例里都会反复出现“近处不是答案”的证据。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/9/code.py:33:#    - 生成器先构造 2 条会交叉的主线, 再构造 2 条不与任何颜色重叠的独立折线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/9/code.py:36:#    - 至少一枚有效红标记来自无交叉颜色, 保证 D11/1 不只是“删掉 assert”而是真正进入样本结构。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/9/code.py:39:#    - 同时又能看到: 不是所有颜色都参与交叉, 因为至少有一条独立颜色只靠自己的缺口与边界延伸被修复。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/9/code.py:41:#    - 交叉只发生在两条主线之间; 独立颜色默认不与交叉邻域重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/9/code.py:42:#    - 红标记、黄标记、交叉格不会堆在同一局部区域, 降低判读噪声。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/9/code.py:46:#    - 假设: 某些颜色可以完全不交叉。保证: `_build_logical` 固定生成两条 detached 折线, 并要求其中至少\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/10/code.py:3:# Name: 交叉选碎片度更低颜色 + 迭代修复直到收敛\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/45a5af55/16/code.py:44:#    - 背景只承担一种职责：垂直分隔。没有额外噪点、标记或局部遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/21/code.py:3:# Name: 交叉选碎片度更低颜色 + 输入交叉处显示第三种颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/28/code.py:58:#    - Marker color appears as a long contiguous line segment, not as isolated specks.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/35/code.py:22:        * 左/右区去对应交叉点的内角;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/4/code.py:3:# Name: 间隙用特殊色填充 + 输入交叉处显示背景色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/23/code.py:182:    - One extra non-black color forms an open rectilinear distractor made of line segments; it can cross real walls but it never encloses a room.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/16/code.py:26:  2. 唯一不接壤控制边的象限不再消失, 而是移到 split 交叉点附近的中心区域。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/45a5af55/14/code.py:68:   - 输出仍是单中心的同心正方形，新增元素只有背景空环，不会引入交叉、遮挡或不规则边界。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:43:#      renders each color exactly once and avoids self-fragmenting occlusion.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:60:#    - Because the distractor is itself made of long line segments, the change is observable in the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:153:    - The remaining color is an open frame-like distractor made of line segments; it may cross a true frame but never closes a room.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:496:        # Fall back only to light crossings near the target range; never prefer heavy occlusion.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/eee78d87/44/code.py:49:  - 晶格与中心印章分区明确：外围是周期纹理，中间是 6x6 图章，不会出现多套颜色编码在同一区域互相遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/10/code.py:65:#       * at least one ctrl-colored split marker line segment\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/36a08778/26/code.py:34:#   本融合不引入新颜色，也不依赖颜色值编码隐藏状态；所有新规则都通过几何结构与先后遮挡体现。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7b80bb43/17/code.py:55:#    - 同一区域不会同时叠加水平 gap、垂直 gap、长链、交叉结构等多层因素；T 结点附近也禁止切 gap，避免难读。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/19/code.py:51:#    控制区仍与底部图案分离，没有遮挡问题。新的合法性约束在于：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7b80bb43/16/code.py:136:    - Large foreground structures are axis-aligned horizontal/vertical line segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/37/code.py:29:      * one vertical red line segment above or below the sprite, aligned to the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/37/code.py:31:      * one horizontal red line segment left or right of the sprite, aligned to\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/37/code.py:328:    - Three colored sprites appear with one nearby red vertical line segment and one nearby red horizontal line segment, together marking the sprite's axis pair.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/36a08778/24/code.py:35:#   水源上，也不放在计划中的水平扩散线上；第三条架子显式避开第二层另一支的列，防止意外交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/13/code.py:47:#      pieces to touch one contiguous split-line segment. Every placement is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/23/code.py:85:  - Split-line fg pixels are added as short connected line segments so the sprite\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/30/code.py:18:      - 其中 2 个来自同一类型边缘, 因而形成两条同向切割线; 第 3 个来自另一类型边缘, 形成交叉切割。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/9/code.py:57:    2-cell line segments only.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/8/code.py:3:# Name: 面对面射线交叉混合\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/38/code.py:389:    Slide rigid yellow line segments inside colored chambers and paint the swept band they cover.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/8/code.py:154:    - Several multi-cell monochrome line segments share one direction and sit on distinct parallel offsets.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/33/code.py:209:    - Foreground objects are five separated horizontal, vertical, or diagonal line segments on distinct\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/10/code.py:9:  - D5/3: movers are rigid yellow line segments instead of independent yellow pixels\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/10/code.py:339:    Slide yellow rigid line segments inside closed wall regions using cardinal legend arrows.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/32/code.py:66:   - The grid contains only the background and the line segments, so the transformation remains easy to\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/15/code.py:177:    - The foreground contains 2-3 groups of multi-cell line segments, and each group is internally\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/14/code.py:470:def _occlusion_kept_count(out: np.ndarray, axis_by_color: dict[int, int], ordered_colors: list[int]) -> int:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/14/code.py:524:    if _occlusion_kept_count(out, axis_by_color, ordered_colors) < 2:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/20/code.py:184:    - Several multi-cell line segments lie on distinct parallel offsets but share one dominant direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/2/code.py:83:   - No auxiliary markers are added. The scene remains just a sparse set of separated line segments on a\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/16/code.py:184:    - Foreground contains 3 or 5 multi-cell line segments, all parallel and placed on distinct perpendicular offsets.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/13/code.py:3:# Name: 交叉标记+链式反应\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f215267/28/code.py:78:#    - 横条颜色总是框色的互补色，而且因为每个样例内都有完整互补对，映射关系可从同一张图中交叉验证。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f215267/28/code.py:96:    \"\"\"Interior-relative columns for a right-anchored continuous line segment.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f215267/28/code.py:105:    Count same-color sprites per frame and display the tally as a complementary line segment.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f215267/28/code.py:189:    \"\"\"Build a FRAME_H x FRAME_W hollow rectangle with a center-row line segment.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/23/code.py:43:#   - 仍用 solver 端到端验收，阻止不同颜色射线冲突或 marker 被其他对象遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f215267/13/code.py:62:    Count frame-matching sprites and encode each tally as a complementary-color line segment.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f215267/13/code.py:150:    \"\"\"Interior-relative columns for a right-anchored continuous line segment.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/12/code.py:18:#    - 若把两个 sprite 做成互相垂直, 3 条水平射线和 3 条竖直射线会产生大量交叉点, 很容易\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/12/code.py:49:#    - 所有射线都平行, 不会形成杂乱交叉.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f215267/14/code.py:49:#    不会遮挡右侧对象，也不会把多种标记混进同一块区域。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/5/code.py:154:    Shift parallel colored line segments so their leading endpoints coincide with a median reference segment.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/28/code.py:17:#   - The canvas contains 7-10 separated monochrome line segments on distinct parallel\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/28/code.py:152:    Normalize many parallel line segments to the length that occurs most often.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/13/code.py:12:    - 7 or 8 parallel line segments, all in one shared direction\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/23/code.py:70:#    The grid still contains only one object family: broken parallel line segments. The added\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/32/code.py:17:#   比原题更短。原题差异点在“按颜色逐杯且无遮挡”，本题差异点在“连通分杯 + 排序阻挡”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/22/code.py:144:    - All meaningful multi-cell objects are horizontal line segments, possibly reusing colors across rows.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2b83f449/19/code.py:3:# Name: 全行令牌+路径交叉检测\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/6/code.py:7:#   Plain line segments are not enough here. If we only changed the input to a centered \"diamond\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/6/code.py:244:    - Several odd-length line segments run in one dominant direction on distinct parallel offsets.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/_review_headers.json:35:    \"doc\": \"Shift parallel colored line segments so their leading endpoints coincide with a median reference segment.  Input structure: - The background is the most common color.\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/_review_headers.json:196:    \"doc\": \"Normalize many parallel line segments to the length that occurs most often.  Input structure: - The background is the most common color.\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/16/code.py:18:#    1. 同色点先枚举所有 H/V/45° 且原图中间无遮挡的候选边，再做确定性 Kruskal，得到最小\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/16/code.py:38:#    - MST 本身新增假设：真实树边必须都出现在“对齐且无遮挡”的候选边里，并且按长度+字典序的\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/16/code.py:56:#    交叉。decoy 是孤立单像素，干扰色也要求彼此非 H/V/diag 对齐，输出保持清爽。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/39/code.py:52:#    - stray pixel 仍只放在某个杯的 mouth 一侧，并避开 cup bbox 与预留路径，避免遮挡关键结构。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/18/code.py:76:   - 假设 5：箭头路径彼此不穿越。generator 用事件追踪拒绝交叉样例。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/13/code.py:44:        - reflect the payload by 180 degrees around the midpoint of the line segment\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/20/code.py:53:#   - `main()` 中每个循环都假设单条射线不会与别的射线共享绘制格；生成器用 output-first 规划并拒绝交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/1/code.py:41:#    - 轨迹只使用一条主链，不叠多层分支；镜面条永远在蓝轨迹之外，避免元素互相遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:65:#    - cross marker 被限制在 3x3 的十字骨架中，信息密度增加但不会遮挡方框边界。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/26/code.py:240:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles with simple occlusion.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/31/code.py:3:# Name: 固定手性+交叉口强制转弯+螺旋走廊\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/27/code.py:326:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles with simple occlusion.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/18/code.py:3:# Name: 反射交叉标记\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/24/code.py:269:    # Need overlap on both axes so each color gets visible occlusion boundaries.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/25/code.py:59:  - 只使用两种走廊族：同 r-c 链与同 r+c 链；不把所有菱形混成满图随机交叉\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/800d221b/20/code.py:150:      may also be extra P line segments that touch neither hub.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/26/code.py:50:    - 只增加“长度补全”这一类变化，不引入额外标记或多层遮挡，保证菱形、线段、stub 关系清楚。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/18/code.py:21:#    - 原题是 30x30 方阵，存在唯一一个纯色实心矩形 marker，输出该矩形下方被遮挡的原始子图。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/3/code.py:321:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/1/code.py:3:# Name: 障碍色转向+交叉口信号灯\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/1/code.py:22:       2. 信号灯层：如果前方一步是特殊信号像素，则它先决定“此交叉口是直行还是转弯”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/1/code.py:23:            * 8 = 在该交叉口转弯\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/1/code.py:24:            * 9 = 在该交叉口直行\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/1/code.py:33:                  ... BG [8] ... 则在 8 这个交叉口直接转入唯一侧支，后面的挡块即使存在也不触发。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/1/code.py:34:   - 差异因此是显式可见的：同样是 T 字交叉口，8/9 决定“转不转”；而 2/3 决定“若转，则朝哪边转”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/1/code.py:41:       * 8/9: 交叉口信号语义\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/1/code.py:52:   - 新增假设 1：若信号色为 8，则信号交叉口必须存在可转入的合法侧支。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/1/code.py:60:   - 所有竖直结构统一按 3 列窗口预留，避免不同交叉口的竖直通道彼此贴边重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/1/code.py:62:   - 信号交叉口使用更直接的 D9 式几何：信号像素就在奇数行通道单元，只有一个上下入口被打开，因此“转弯”是唯一可执行动作。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/1/code.py:70:   - 样例里至少有一条粒子路径先经过 9 再撞到 2/3，因此人类能看到“先看信号决定是否进交叉口，再看挡块颜色决定向哪边转”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/1/code.py:81:       * 8/9 控制“是否在交叉口转”\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/1/code.py:86:   - `_choose_signal_turn()` 假设信号交叉口若有多个候选方向，则前方挡块色可消歧；generator 当前主要生成唯一侧支，所以这个回退分支只是容错。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/37/code.py:282:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/1/code.py:25:# - 但被遮挡像素的恢复机制不再使用整条 4 点轨道，而只看它的 180 度对径：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/1/code.py:52:# - 输出仍是矩形切片；跨样例观察时，可以看出被遮挡内容与对面的 180 度区域一致。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/1/code.py:67:# - `main()` 假设 marker 全在旋转主方块内，且每个遮挡格的 180 度对径不是 marker；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/3/code.py:180:    Recover several small rectangular occlusions from a bilaterally symmetric grid and pack them into one strip.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/11/code.py:39:      本来会走过但最终保持背景的通道，从而避免逻辑退化和视觉遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/11/code.py:48:    - 每条走廊只服务于一个外边框，active 射线与 inactive 空走廊都不与别的对象交叉，图面清爽。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/8/code.py:52:# - After adding trails, painter order matters for both line segments and stamped copies. We\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/7/code.py:15:#    - 原题在同一个 lo 上同时做 LR/UD 反射，遮挡格会沿四元轨道恢复；D1 单变体则改成\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/7/code.py:16:#      整张棋盘的单一对角镜像，每个遮挡格只需看它的对角伙伴。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/7/code.py:25:#    - 对遮挡恢复而言，若标记盖住 (2, 9)，solver 直接读可见的 (9, 2)。若标记盖住\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/7/code.py:36:#      单纯的全局对角遮挡题。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/17/code.py:337:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles with painter's-algorithm occlusion.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/39/code.py:18:#      与此同时 br 的最短路仍朝交叉区域前进。逐轮扩展时，tl 因为从 top 边更早进入，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/39/code.py:42:#    - 生成器先选两条具有原始交叉趋势的 L 组件，再搜索小障碍 blob；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/15/code.py:37:  - 只强制一组覆盖对，其余边仍随机，既能看出规律，也不会把整张图做成大面积网状交叉\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/15/code.py:59:  - 只强制单通道覆盖，减少同一区域多层交叉\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/2/code.py:38:#     - 主组件全部走同一中轴，且投影区间彼此不交叉，避免输出中心区域出现难以分辨的覆盖。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/40/code.py:227:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/9/code.py:66:#     - solver 只会在背景格上延长射线；output-first 校验保证不会因遮挡导致错误输出。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/39/code.py:55:- The original generator allowed visible L-shapes via occlusion. That breaks the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/39/code.py:86:  than the original irregular occlusion version.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/20/code.py:315:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/10/code.py:33:#    - The visual change is obvious: diamonds become pluses and line segments disappear into dots.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/10/code.py:228:    The two marker colors are two occlusion layers over the same symmetric texture. Some inner-cross cells cannot trust the raw\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/21/code.py:190:    - Direction no longer comes from a line segment slope. The L shape itself encodes the ray\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/21/code.py:33:#    - The variant adds exactly one extra occlusion layer and one extra identification pass.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/21/code.py:218:    Recover a nested two-layer occlusion by repeatedly identifying the current symmetry-breaking color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/9/code.py:276:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles with painter's-algorithm occlusion.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/10/code.py:279:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/13/code.py:26:#   当作遮挡区域。恢复机制本身仍沿用原题的 LR+UD 反射轨道，必要时再用转置回退。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/13/code.py:3:# Name: 密集交叉标记\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:13:#    - 画面仍是 30x30 方阵、唯一一个实心矩形 marker、输出该矩形被遮挡的原始子图。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:16:#    - 对每个被遮挡像素，solver 不再收集整条 LR/UD 轨道的可见值，而是按固定优先级逐层尝试：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/19/code.py:27:- 若不同 mover 的目标太近, 实心化后的矩形会大面积互相遮挡, 样例会变乱; 因此行/列标记按 bbox 高宽做跨颜色间距控制。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/19/code.py:50:- 右框内仍只有矩形复制结果, 不再出现“框内标记 + 复杂局部遮挡 + 原地保留 mover”的混杂局面。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/21/code.py:3:# Name: 交叉口强制转弯+Z形走廊\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/36/code.py:278:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles with painter's-algorithm occlusion.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/22/code.py:251:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/15/code.py:40:#     - 仍只有三层对象：框架、横杆、彩色堆叠。输出里颜色只出现在凸起正上方，不会引入新的标记层或遮挡关系。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/20/code.py:39:#    根 blob 远离边界，保证四边框和四向射线大多可见；子 blob 最多 1 个，避免多树交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/30/code.py:67:#   样例稳定归纳“同色匹配后在交叉点复制”这一规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/41/code.py:3:# Name: 交叉口信号灯+边缘图例\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/23/code.py:48:#      唯一、无遮挡，并且 2 像素端口在输出里实际发射出足够长的可见轨迹。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/10/code.py:68:#    - 所有 blob 都要求完整在界内、彼此保持至少 1 像素 8 邻域间隔, 且新射线不能与既有 blob / 射线交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/10/code.py:79:#    - 采用单主干 + 侧枝终止的树形生成, 避免多层交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/10/code.py:92:#       会得到稳定树形而不会出现歧义交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/20270e3b/27/code.py:53:#    - 虽然允许重叠，但重叠集中在共享竖干和少量 rib 交叉处，且 connector 长度只取 1/2/3，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7666fa5d/1/code.py:93:- The scene remains only line segments plus filled bands; no extra markers or\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7666fa5d/1/code.py:115:  the same color could merge with a line segment and stop looking like a pure\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7666fa5d/1/code.py:268:    - Multiple non-background colors form short 8-connected line segments, each\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7666fa5d/1/code.py:289:    assert segs, \"grid must contain anti-diagonal line segments\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7491f3cf/1/code.py:3:# Name: 十字交叉分割+8-连通flood-fill\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/20270e3b/30/code.py:70:    - 组装时只允许“桥接相邻”，不允许任何两块真正重叠；这使得异长竖条的尾部也保持干净，不会出现多余遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5545f144/8/code.py:28:  only. This is enough to make occlusion visually obvious without turning the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5545f144/8/code.py:65:  visible alignment, distance, and occlusion matter.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7666fa5d/2/code.py:75:    Fill the parallelogram-like gaps between parallel main-diagonal line segments with red.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/27/code.py:3:# Name: 最短路径+反射交叉+旋转节点+多标记编码\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/27/code.py:26:#    - 交叉/拐弯节点改成两类可见标记：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/27/code.py:30:#    - color-9 不再是原题里的宽接合体，也不再承担交叉反射；这里把它们改成可穿越的“旋转门”矩形块，路径从一侧进入、从对侧出来，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/27/code.py:69:#      0=走廊背景，2=墙，5=交叉编码，8=输出路径，9=旋转门，其他少量颜色只给 token。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7666fa5d/9/code.py:23:#    The visible objects remain short line segments on anti-diagonals k=r+c, and red fill still grows\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7666fa5d/9/code.py:63:#    Same-k splitting is removed, so every anti-diagonal shows a single clean line segment. Keeping only\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7666fa5d/9/code.py:146:    - Convert each connected line segment into its anti-diagonal index k and its covered b-range.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7666fa5d/10/code.py:132:    Recover horizontal line segments, then fill by columns.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7666fa5d/10/code.py:155:    assert segs, \"expected horizontal line segments\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/24/code.py:35:#    - 原 main() 假设一整个 connected component 可以含多条通道和交叉；这里\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7666fa5d/4/code.py:71:    \"\"\"Return line segments as (k, b_min, b_max), sorted by anti-diagonal index.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/1/code.py:3:# Name: BFS激活+反射交叉\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/1/code.py:52:#    - 结构采用单连通骨架: 顶部总线、底部总线、两块串联镜面和若干竖向叶子，避免密集交叉噪声。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/3/code.py:52:#    - 角标固定放在矩形 core 外侧一个角，不遮挡 core 图案；模板条带和外部 sprite 之间仍保留背景间隔。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/20270e3b/13/code.py:16:      - 为了防止退化成“按长度/形状配对”，干扰连接器采用交叉长度：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/20270e3b/13/code.py:40:    - 交叉长度让错误的“按形状配对”策略会挑到干扰条，从而保证颜色线索真的有用。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/15/code.py:8:# - 原题里，真正的十字交叉会在穿行方向的前后各 1 格放一对灰色 5，显式提示“直行不要转弯”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/15/code.py:10:# - 本融合进一步把少量灰色 5 保留下来，但不再放在交叉旁边；它们改为出现在需要离开竖直主干的 T 形结点同列、前后 2 或 3 格。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/14/code.py:59:#    这样即使有 9 号矩形和 5 号交叉标记，顶/底 token 区仍然清楚可读。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:3:# Name: 方向标记引导+颜色编码交叉\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:8:#    - 基础题里，token 变形规则不复杂，关键是沿青色网络把“互补形”送到另一端。原 solver 在交叉处几乎总能靠\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:10:#    - 这个融合版把交叉处拆成两层信号：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:15:#      * 第二层是交叉两侧成对的颜色标记：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:24:#    - 箭头家族只保留两类（左右交换槽），交叉颜色也只保留两类（直行 / 转弯），总离散档位很少，便于从 2-4 个样例归纳。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:25:#    - 为了让两层规则都可见，生成器要求每题至少出现 2 个彩色交叉，且 red / blue 都实际出现；同时要求蓝色覆盖会改变\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:28:#      token 始终是 3x3 图案并远离端点，交叉标记始终成对夹在管道两侧。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:31:#    - 原 _trace_wire 依赖“交叉处直行优先”即可正确；在本变体里，纯箭头交叉和红色交叉都可能要求立刻离开当前方向，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:33:#    - 原 track_mask = 非背景减 token，会把箭头对角装饰误当轨道支路。新版只把 8/9、红蓝交叉夹子和“解码出的箭头中心”\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:37:#    - 原 9-rect 识别只把 (5,8) 当作管道邻接。新版必须把 1/2/4/5 都视为 wire-like，否则矩形贴着箭头或交叉时会漏掉面连接。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:40:#    - 通道列仍按 4-5 列间距布置，水平槽只在 crossover row 出现；这样交叉夹子 (c-1,c+1) 不会和相邻通道混叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:47:#    - 观察者可以同时看到：交叉中心出现彩色箭头、两侧再出现红/蓝成对夹子。相同箭头家族在多个交叉重复出现，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:48:#      但红蓝会把这些交叉分成“执行箭头转向”和“无视箭头直行”两类。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:53:#    - 主线仍保持 8/9 的大块结构；箭头只占交叉中心和一个对角像素，红蓝标记只占中心左右两格，没有额外铺满局部区域。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:54:#    - token、箭头、交叉夹子、9-rect 各自的几何角色固定，视觉上容易分层：3x3 token、正交主线、矩形块、交叉提示。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:58:#    - 蓝色交叉是关键：它与红色交叉共享同类箭头，但输出行为不同，因此解题者能从少量样例学到优先级而不是把箭头当唯一规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:62:#    - solver 假设每个带红蓝夹子的交叉一定也是一个已解码箭头中心；generator 在每个被彩色控制的交叉上总是先放箭头再放夹子。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:63:#    - solver 假设蓝色交叉上保持直行时，当前方向前方确实还有轨道；continuous columns + 水平槽骨架保证这一点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/4/code.py:24:# - 原题 solver 的关键假设是 4 邻接管道；D1 单变体把它放宽到 8 邻接并在单个 diagonal X 交叉处保持“直行优先”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c7dc4dd/24/code.py:20:#      (`fill`); another training source is two disconnected line segments that become only their endpoints\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/23/code.py:38:#    - token 仍然放在 degree-1 端点外 2 格的 3x3 框中；通道列、上下 token 行、交叉行都沿用原题几何，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/23/code.py:40:#    - 受控 9-rect 只放在确定为纯竖直单线段的带状区域，并做 1 格间隔检查，不与 token、交叉线或其他\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2ba387bc/18/code.py:76:#      no extra markers, no overlays, no partial occlusion.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5545f144/23/code.py:102:#      wall occlusion would change or invalidate the solve. The generator measures\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5545f144/23/code.py:341:        f\"{dirs_with_candidates}, expected exactly one after wall occlusion\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5545f144/23/code.py:432:    Key insight: the actor is the unique 5-cell L component, and wall occlusion turns\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D9/0/code.py:241:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/37/code.py:15:      - 因此输入中的某个带洞精灵，视觉上可能像“洞被别的颜色暂时填住”，但那只是散布遮挡，不是已经完成拼装。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/37/code.py:33:      - 帮助识别模板的边界/端口邻域证据不会被层叠遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/37/code.py:47:    - 变化只依赖形状、洞、端口和遮挡关系，不依赖颜色编号的不可见语义。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D8/0/code.py:257:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D1/1/code.py:234:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D1/3/code.py:236:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D1/2/code.py:282:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D3/1/code.py:215:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/30/code.py:50:#    控制结构全部压在底两行，且只使用一种控制色；四条车道横向间隔固定，线段永不交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D12/1/code.py:295:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D13/0/code.py:344:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D13/1/code.py:242:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D13/2/code.py:233:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/0/code.py:3:# Change: collision_detection——90度交角碰撞时两条射线各转45度并在交叉点留1像素间隙、以单像素绘制；45度... → 碰撞即停止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/3/code.py:43:#    - 原 main 在 `filled_mask` 之后假设 obstacle 是静止遮挡物, 通过 `shadow_process` 擦掉填充. 该假设失效,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/32/code.py:36:#     - 变化都限制在各自 3x3 单元格内部，宏观层面只是把若干单元格替换成 source，不会出现多层覆盖互相遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/1/code.py:3:# Change: collision_detection——90度交角碰撞时两条射线各转45度并在交叉点留1像素间隙、以单像素绘制；45度... → 碰撞时颜色混合\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/1/code.py:32:#      再统一计算共享格/几何交叉并覆写混色标记. 这样不会把“碰撞像素”误当成障碍物.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:265:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles (simple occlusion, painter's algorithm).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/2/code.py:3:# Change: collision_detection——90度交角碰撞时两条射线各转45度并在交叉点留1像素间隙、以单像素绘制；45度... → 碰撞时相互穿过并交换颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/36/code.py:57:#   同时把 anchor 的额外 slot 限制在 top/bottom 两侧，减少角落遮挡和难读接触关系。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D10/0/code.py:264:    \"\"\"Paint 2-3 overlapping rectangles with painter's-algorithm occlusion.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/19/code.py:29:#   - 原阴影逻辑若直接作用于全部新填色，会把内部描边也擦掉；因此这里只让障碍遮挡外辐射区。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/21/code.py:16:#      line segment is recolored to 9.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/21/code.py:20:#      then the ray stops at line cell (6,8) and the whole line segment turns 9.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/21/code.py:38:#      now matters: paint trail cells first, then recolor hit line segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/21/code.py:73:#      triangle or a straight line segment of length >= 4; the generator constructs\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/21/code.py:80:#    - Whole-line recoloring assumes contiguous line segments can be recovered from one\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/21/code.py:282:      or longer 1-cell-thick horizontal/vertical line segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/21/code.py:290:    - When a line is struck, recolor the entire contiguous line segment containing that hit\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/38/code.py:43:#    开口总数固定为 2，且桥缺口与弧缺口分属不同部位，能避免大量射线互相交叉。外部填充被两条平行\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/291dc1e1/29/code.py:3:# Name: 不规则分布+十字交叉线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/23/code.py:3:# Name: 轨迹允许交叉+无分隔条\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/291dc1e1/26/code.py:3:# Name: 距离逆序+十字交叉线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/12/code.py:3:# Name: 粒子相遇停止+轨迹允许交叉+碰撞后发射新粒子\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8b9c3697/2/code.py:37:#     - 继续使用 output-first：每个结构补丁的 occupancy 同时覆盖结构、最终红块、黑轨迹以及输入态真红块/诱饵红块，因此不同补丁不会互相遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/8/code.py:42:#    - solver 新增假设: 墙像素可由某个最近区域唯一归属；生成器用无交叉的 2 厚平行墙保证这一点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8b9c3697/10/code.py:45:#   保持视觉整洁并减少偶然遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:34:#     - 其余框随机放置，但其射线路径必须与已有路径集合不相交，避免动态遮挡把样例变乱。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/0/code.py:3:# Change: 所有射线同时发射并独立延伸，碰撞在轨迹交叉时自然发生（无显式顺序）... → 按框架距离排序处理\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8b9c3697/23/code.py:57:#      4 邻域，防止组件粘连、误匹配或遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/2/code.py:3:# Change: 所有射线同时发射并独立延伸，碰撞在轨迹交叉时自然发生（无显式顺序）... → 迭代碰撞——碰撞后的新方向射线可再次碰撞\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/2/code.py:44:#     - 额外随机块默认关闭，避免把级联区域变成难以辨认的杂乱交叉网。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/4/code.py:203:#   reconstructed from each row's stripe period, stripe length, and nearest-first occlusion pattern.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/16/code.py:54:    - tile 之间只用墙色分隔列，不再叠加其他装饰，避免“墙、marker、填充”三类信息互相遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/291dc1e1/23/code.py:33:#   的交叉结构：两个面积各出现两次，两个颜色各出现两次，且同一面积里混有两种颜色、\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/291dc1e1/23/code.py:58:# - 仍然只有边线、角点标记和若干矩形三类元素；无遮挡、无重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/291dc1e1/22/code.py:61:#    不引入遮挡或额外标记层，输入和输出都保持规整。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b5ca7ac4/21/code.py:40:# - 同侧最多两层，避免多层级遮挡造成样例过乱。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b5ca7ac4/11/code.py:51:#   - 生成器继续做整网格矩形重叠检查，防止输入方块互相遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/42/code.py:33:#     - 另外，生成器稳定加入至少一枚“旧 BFS 可达、但新射线不可见”的室内栗色；并在部分射线上放置被前景遮挡的深层栗色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b5ca7ac4/19/code.py:40:#    - 合并只移除共享内墙，不额外添加标记；因此输出仍局限在左右两块堆叠区，没有遮挡到背景中的其它区域。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/50/code.py:39:#      so the solver must draw full line segments rather than recolor isolated cells.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D4/1/code.py:4:#   -> 栗色仅出现在格栅线与字形的交叉处\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/78332cb0/D13/2/code.py:58:# - 使用 5x5 块自身已有的“左臂/中脊/右臂”或“上臂/中脊/下臂”来承载三段颜色，不会造成遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:3:# Name: X形双对角线+交叉特殊颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:21:#     - 再加入交叉着色：若某个偶数长度 X 的两条蓝线在中心格重合，该中心格输出为特殊色 2；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:24:#     - 只允许一个固定特殊色 2，避免把“哪种交叉映射到哪种颜色”变成不可归纳的多分支规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:25:#     - 生成器强制出现三类证据：至少一个 cross-only trigger、至少一个蓝蓝交叉、至少一个蓝线-品红射线交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:27:#     - 额外段默认与已有输出隔离，只把核心交叉放在一个受控局部，避免整图过度混杂。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:30:#     - 原 main() 直接把蓝线写入 out，再让射线只填背景，隐含假设“蓝线-射线交叉保持蓝色”；融合后失效，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:31:#       需要先得到蓝色结构集合/覆盖次数，再单独渲染特殊交叉色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:32:#     - 现在蓝蓝交叉也有语义，因此蓝色结构不能只记录集合，还要记录每格被多少条蓝线覆盖。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:37:#     - 强制样例先放一个“主 X”：它长度取偶数，天然提供一个蓝蓝交叉中心；再放一个被主 X 的 direct trigger\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:38:#       射线击中的目标段，确保蓝线-射线交叉存在且不落在端点/trigger 上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:44:#     - 为了让这一点可见，生成器限制额外 trigger 数量，并拒绝大面积重叠、ray-ray 纠缠和 trigger 落在交叉中心。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:46:#     - solver 允许一格被多条蓝线结构性覆盖，但假设真正的输入 trigger 不会正好占据需要被重涂为特殊色的交叉格；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7491f3cf/D7/2/code.py:37:#    - 只在 tile0 增加 1 个像素，且仍沿用边缘 anchor，避免在中心区域制造遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/_final_summary_20260517.json:118:    \"name\": \"X形双对角线+交叉特殊颜色\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/_final_summary_20260517.json:130:    \"name\": \"区域填色+交叉触发新延伸\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/_final_summary_20260517.json:141:    \"name\": \"正交延伸+碰撞停止+交叉标色\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/_final_summary_20260517.json:384:    \"name\": \"迭代传播+遇线停止+交叉触发新延伸\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/28/code.py:28:#    - 共享品红点还会在两条线的交叉处生成四向斜射线，样例里能稳定展示“一个点可被多条线同时触发”的现象。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/28/code.py:30:#    - 只保留 3 条有效蓝段和 1 个共享触发点，避免出现多组交叉共享导致难以分辨。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/34/code.py:3:# Name: 迭代传播+遇线停止+交叉触发新延伸\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/9/code.py:51:      防止后续段或干扰像素占进去，造成“看起来像被遮挡”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/9/code.py:66:    - main() 默认有效触发点不会被别的线段共享；生成器通过 reserved 集避免段交叉和射线穿越。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/13/code.py:3:# Name: 正交延伸+碰撞停止+交叉标色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b5ca7ac4/12/code.py:89:- The generator limits the deliberate partial-overlap occlusion to one compact cluster\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:14:#       原题输出只有蓝线和品红斜射线；融合后还会多出红色十字分支，并把两个触发点和中心等交叉格统一涂成黄色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:17:#     - 第三步使用单一特殊色 4，避免与红色触发器混淆；否则人类难以区分“红色是触发源”还是“红色是交叉结果”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:20:#     - 原 solver 允许“最长同色对角对”在所有非背景颜色中竞争；融合后红/品红会大量重复，必须排除触发色和交叉色，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:23:#     - 原 D9 单变体只需记录两种对角斜率；融合后还要新增横向与纵向两个方向家族，否则无法识别红色十字与其交叉点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:24:#     - 原题默认输出专用笔画互不相交；融合后第三步恰恰依赖交叉，因此 generator 要主动构造至少一个非触发交叉点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:26:#     - 生成器先固定一组共享中心的 \\ 与 / 主对角线，输入只保留四个端点和两个触发器，中心是输出阶段才出现的交叉格。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:32:#     - 每个样例都强制存在主线中心交叉点，且该点不是输入触发器；这使第三步可被看成“所有交叉都变黄”，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:36:#     - 交叉变换只改色、不扩形，输出层级稳定为：蓝骨架 / 品红斜枝 / 红色十字枝 / 黄色交叉标记。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:39:#       且至少一个非触发交叉点。generate_input() 通过“相交双主线 + 双真实触发器 + 预留所有笔画格”来保证这些前提。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/12/code.py:5:# Name: 区域填色+交叉触发新延伸\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/16/code.py:26:#    original is therefore twofold: bodies are skinny line segments, and solved sprites\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/16/code.py:31:#    line segments and lengths 2..7, which is visually distinct from the old blocky\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/16/code.py:66:#    - The remaining cells form a 1-pixel-wide line segment of length 2..7.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/4/code.py:32:#    - 仍然只有一种前景色，不添加任何辅助标记；结构是规整的同心矩形螺旋，不会出现多对象互相遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D15/2/code.py:20:      - 非锚点精灵仍然用唯一主色 + 红色端口表示，但散布时至少有一对精灵发生真实遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D15/2/code.py:21:      - 遮挡采取“上层不透明覆盖下层”的可见规则：下层被盖住的位置在输入里完全看不见，只能从剩余轮廓和端口反推。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D15/2/code.py:22:      - 为了让被遮挡精灵仍可恢复，非锚点精灵改成确定性模板：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D15/2/code.py:26:      - generator 只允许遮挡下层的“内部彩色通路”，不遮挡红端口、不遮挡端口旁的归属像素、不遮挡能确定 bbox 的外轮廓证据。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D15/2/code.py:32:    - 只引入一类新困难：层叠遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D15/2/code.py:33:    - 不做任意形状遮挡，而只遮挡内部通路，避免把任务退化成不可判定的图像补全。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D15/2/code.py:34:    - 每个非锚点颜色保持唯一，颜色只用于“分离被遮挡的碎片”，不参与排序或规则映射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D15/2/code.py:45:    - 除该一对层叠外，其余精灵不再强制大间隔，只要求不额外重叠；这样把自由度留给 D15 的真实遮挡，而不是让生成失败在散布留白上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D15/2/code.py:50:    - 遮挡层数固定为 2，不做多层堆叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D15/2/code.py:51:    - 遮挡区域限制在内部通路，避免把外框和红端口压成难以辨认的混色团。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D15/2/code.py:56:    - main 假设被遮挡精灵的外边界仍然可见，且别的精灵红端口不会落在它的 bbox 边界上；scatter 的层叠合法性检查保证这一点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D15/2/code.py:58:    - main 假设被遮挡精灵的 bbox 与端口仍可从可见轮廓中恢复；scatter 只遮挡内部彩色通路。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/17/code.py:3:# Name: 三色部分可见遮挡匹配\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/17/code.py:35:#   pixels outside that rectangle. This makes the two-part occlusion visually explicit\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/17/code.py:52:# - Scatter cells are chosen strictly outside that rectangle, so the two occlusion modes\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/17/code.py:294:    raise RuntimeError(\"failed to generate a unique mixed-occlusion crop\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/18/code.py:27:#     - 双面输出只是对输入和右半结果做水平拼接，不新增对象，也不会引入重叠、越界或遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/4/code.py:258:    occlusion = _make_corner_mask(H, W, reflected_corner, cut_h, cut_w)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/4/code.py:259:    out[occlusion] = int(mask_color)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8e5c0c38/D5/0/code.py:29:        height >1 is the \"vertical line segment\" marker.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/6ffbe589/D4/1/code.py:160:    assert area == length, \"expected the cue to be a solid line segment\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/6ffbe589/D4/1/code.py:174:    - Outside the board, some board colors have one separate monochrome cue, and each cue is a straight horizontal or vertical line segment.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/30/code.py:46:#      没有多层遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/221dfab4/D8/1/code.py:3:# Change: 绿色条纹将全行/列非背景像素重着色为绿色(3)；黄色条纹覆盖跨度内的色块像素... → 色块保持原色不变（条纹被色块遮挡）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/42/code.py:35:      - 若第二条轨迹穿过第一条轨迹，则交叉处显示后者；若第二个 sprite 覆盖了第一条轨迹，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/42/code.py:82:    顺序覆盖主要发生在轨迹交叉处，不要求大面积 trail-vs-sprite 互相涂抹，因此画面仍像\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D5/0/code.py:57:# - 上方源水仓是规则矩形/台阶状堆积，不和下方盆地交叉，画面层次清楚。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/f560132c/D16/0/code.py:3:# Change: 矩形被分为4个象限，分割线为一条水平线和一条垂直线交叉（十字分割），但交叉点可以偏离中心... → 对角线分割\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/17/code.py:31:      交叉处最终显示为 4，因为“后处理覆盖先处理”。差异不再只是“多了轨迹”，而是轨迹的\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/17/code.py:32:      颜色交叉结果依赖于处理顺序。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/17/code.py:37:      否则颜色升序很容易退化成“只有一两条线，没有交叉，顺序无关”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/17/code.py:41:      4 条轨迹都存在，且生成器主动搜索能产生可见轨迹交叉的散布布局。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/17/code.py:65:      - 轨迹交叉足够多，使顺序效应可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/17/code.py:69:    - 多个颜色在交叉处出现覆盖，且哪个颜色压住别人会在不同样例里稳定遵循同一颜色优先级。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/17/code.py:70:    - 颜色优先级虽然内部实现为升序，但生成器固定反复使用少量颜色 {1,2,3,4} 并制造交叉，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/17/code.py:77:    - 不再加入干扰物，避免视觉噪声掩盖顺序交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/17/code.py:82:      由于颜色种类固定且样例中会重复出现多色交叉，这个规则有结构性线索可归纳。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/f560132c/D3/1/code.py:84:#   - overlap is concentrated near quadrant boundaries and the center, avoiding chaotic full-canvas occlusion\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D2/1/code.py:39:#     - 每个样本只叠加三类元素：底部盆地、左上导流件、源水列；区域分工明确，不会互相遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/0/code.py:84:   The interleaved solver now assumes that any same-shape shadow/main occlusion it\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/3/code.py:50:- 盆地和导流件始终分布在固定的大区域：水仓在一侧上方，盆地在下半部，避免对象相互遮挡导致画面杂乱。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/1/code.py:4:#         变为：主线和阴影线混合后按线段长度从长到短统一绘制，仍然只占用背景格，因此长线会在交叉点优先“抢占”像素。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/1/code.py:23:#    所以一旦主边和阴影边相交，主边永远赢，因为它更早占住交叉格。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/1/code.py:26:#    顶边及其阴影长 8，竖边及其阴影长 4。原题在交叉点 (1,7) 保留主竖边颜色；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/1/code.py:33:#    让长边和短边在主线/阴影线之间发生交叉，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/1/code.py:59:#    - 假设：要看到 D19，至少要有一组“长度不同且发生交叉”的主/阴影边。生成器固定首个形状为非正方形矩形，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D2/1/code.py:39:#    - 所有 patch 在全局 canvas 上用 random_free_location 放置，并保留 >=1 背景缓冲，避免跨对象遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/34/code.py:65:# - 所有对象尺寸小、间距固定、无遮挡。hub 保持中心清晰，精灵散放远离 hub；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D5/1/code.py:263:    Swing an irregular line segment around a nearby obstacle sprite.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D5/2/code.py:440:    Swing an irregular line segment around the nearest obstacle and stack it onto the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D8/3/code.py:30:# - Side lengths are kept in a moderate range (5-11) so the line segments remain\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D8/3/code.py:38:#   line segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D8/3/code.py:212:    - A unique marker color forms exactly two disconnected line segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D1/1/code.py:11:#    - plus: 5 格十字，中心在交叉点\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D3/1/code.py:15:#    先枚举所有 H/V/45° 且中间无遮挡的同色候选边，再按长度最短优先做确定性 Kruskal，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D3/1/code.py:48:#    main() 现在假设：某个可解的同色对象，其所有真实边都包含在“对齐且无遮挡”的候选边集中，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D1/2/code.py:45:#     - 多 triple 仍通过 expanded bbox 预留空隙，避免不同局部互相遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D3/3/code.py:50:# - 每个 shape 只使用一个中心 hub，不做多中心或交叉重连，避免杂乱。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D13/1/code.py:30:#     - 两条 input segments 都朝远离 obstacle 的方向长出，避免遮挡共享目标这个核心线索。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7b3084d4/20/code.py:18:#    Real pixel occlusion would hide information and make 2-4 examples\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D3/0/code.py:284:    Swing an irregular line segment around a nearby obstacle sprite, then keep painting in the exit direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D3/1/code.py:276:    Swing an irregular line segment around a nearby obstacle sprite, then paint a dashed rerouted trace.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D3/3/code.py:490:    Swing an irregular line segment around a nearby obstacle sprite, preserving length.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D12/0/code.py:3:# Change: 各容器独立处理，互不影响（路径不交叉，无顺序依赖）... → 按距离排序处理\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D7/1/code.py:283:    Swing an irregular line segment around a nearby obstacle sprite, preserving its pixel count.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D12/1/code.py:3:# Change: 各容器独立处理，互不影响（路径不交叉，无顺序依赖）... → 链式反应\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D12/1/code.py:41:#     - 一条链单独占据一个区域，没有交叉、重叠或多层标记，读图清楚。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/42/code.py:79:    - strip 模板固定且稀疏，不会出现复杂轮廓相互遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D12/2/code.py:3:# Change: 各容器独立处理，互不影响（路径不交叉，无顺序依赖）... → 容器按颜色分组同步移动\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D7/3/code.py:290:    Swing an irregular line segment around a nearby obstacle sprite, then fill the obstacle-facing gap.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D13/2/code.py:3:# Change: 行和列独立处理——射线只沿射击方向（行或列）填充，不存在行列交叉... → L形路径\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/9/code.py:21:#       干扰点位于网格单元中，视觉上容易和“普通网格交叉点附近的单点”混淆。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D10/2/code.py:44:      - 只有 \"8 方向对齐 + 原图中间无遮挡 + 线段内部没有别的同色顶点\" 的点对才算原子边。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D10/2/code.py:87:    - 每棵树最多一个折弯枝，防止局部过密和难辨认交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/581f7754/D5/1/code.py:31:#       “无遮挡时到锚点”和“有障碍时提前停下”两个分支。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/581f7754/D5/1/code.py:43:#       从而避免 solver 顺序 paste 时产生额外遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f215267/D5/4/code.py:36:#   线段只出现在框中心行，右侧 sprite 区域与框区域完全分离，因此不会引入新的视觉遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f215267/D5/4/code.py:48:    Count same-color patterns per frame and represent the tally as a right-anchored line segment.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f215267/D5/4/code.py:131:    \"\"\"Interior-relative columns for a right-anchored continuous line segment.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f215267/D5/4/code.py:139:    \"\"\"Build a FRAME_H x FRAME_W hollow rectangle with a center-row line segment.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D5/0/code.py:2:# Dimension: D5 — 交叉处的颜色消歧规则 (transform)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D5/0/code.py:3:# Change: 黄色控制射线优先；否则原始交叉处选碎片度更高的颜色（pre-repair连通分量更多者胜出），纯填充交叉选较小颜色ID... → 交叉处选碎片度更低的颜色（更完整者胜出）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D1/2/code.py:41:#       - \"Frames are non-overlapping, so bbox center is not distorted by occlusion.\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D5/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D5 — 交叉处的颜色消歧规则 (transform)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D5/1/code.py:3:# Change: 黄色控制射线优先；否则原始交叉处选碎片度更高的颜色（pre-repair连通分量更多者胜出），纯填充交叉选较小颜色ID... → 交叉处选线段更长的颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D12/0/code.py:73:  geometry and occlusion, not on numeric color ordering.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D9/1/code.py:3:# Change: 直角折线（rectilinear polylines），每分量0-6个转角，每色1-4个连通分量，端点垂直于边界... → T形/十字形交叉节点\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/2/code.py:59:#   occlusion, restricts overlap amount, and only scatters pad pixels on non-frame cells.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4a21e3da/D16/1/code.py:21:      - 唯一变化: 原先“消失”的象限不再删除, 而是滑向分割线交叉点附近的内角:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4a21e3da/D16/1/code.py:47:    - 该块保留在 split 交叉点旁边, 与“去角落”的其他片段形成稳定对比, 2-3 个样例即可观察到。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D7/2/code.py:45:#     - 角落局部 shape 避免多组在中心大面积交叉，输出更整洁。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D12/1/code.py:292:        f\"{dirs_with_candidates}, expected exactly one after wall occlusion\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:27:#      * Variant: distractor color forms long line segments inside one bbox; after cropping,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:179:    - One extra non-black color forms an open rectilinear distractor made of line segments; it may cross real walls but it does not enclose any region by itself.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D3/1/code.py:14:#   red marker replaces two consecutive cells on a straight line segment, so the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D9/1/code.py:52:#      单层水平排布，不叠放、不交叉，避免杂乱。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D4/0/code.py:18:#       - 输出仍是 12x12 上的单像素宽正交折线网络, 颜色之间允许交叉\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D4/0/code.py:29:#       - 仍保留 2-4 条线色、交叉、碎片度裁决与黄色翻臂, 所以任务没有被简化成单一路径修补\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/2c181942/D14/1/code.py:3:# Change: 单步处理——所有精灵独立匹配和贴附，顺序无关（不存在精灵间遮挡冲突）... → 链式贴附：先贴附的精灵成为后续贴附的锚点\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:2:# Dimension: D14 — 输入中交叉处的显示策略 (meta)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:3:# Change: 输入中交叉处显示'失败者'颜色（碎片度消歧的输者），输出中显示'胜者'颜色... → 输入中交叉处显示背景色（完全隐藏）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:12:#       - 输出中的交叉显示规则仍是“按输入中可见碎片数更多的颜色获胜”；这里的碎片数只统计真正可见的线色块，不把红/黄标记当作线段本体。黄射线若经过交叉则仍强制获胜。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:14:#       - 输入中的每个真实交叉格都不再显示任一线色，而是直接留成背景色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:15:#       - 因此 solver 不能再从交叉格里读到“失败者”颜色，只能先把两条线各自补回，再在重叠格处做胜者判定。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:17:#     - 对每个真实交叉点，输入里会同时出现“一条水平 1 格缺口”和“一条竖直 1 格缺口”，它们在同一格相交。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:22:#       - 假设蓝线与绿线在 (5,6) 逻辑交叉，输入会把 (5,6) 画成失败者颜色，例如绿色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:25:#       - 同一个交叉在输入里把 (5,6) 留空。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:29:#       - 原题“交叉位置已显式给出，但颜色是错的”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:30:#       - 变体“交叉位置与颜色都要从两条线的间隙共同恢复”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:32:#     - 仍只允许 2-4 种线色，避免隐藏交叉后的匹配组合爆炸。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:33:#     - 生成器继续禁止同色结点与三线交汇，保证每个多色 claim 都是两条正交线的二元交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:34:#     - 为避免人类/solver 被颜色 id 的隐式 tie-break 误导，生成器给跨越全部交叉的主线额外放置 2 个红标记，并要求所有非黄射线交叉的胜负在碎片数上严格分出高下。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:36:#     - `main()` 中 marker 赋色依赖“沿四个方向能看到某条可见线色”；隐藏交叉只把交叉格改成背景，不会破坏这条前提。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:37:#     - `should_fill()` 依赖“缺口两端仍在同一行或同一列可见”；隐藏交叉正是这种 1 格缺口，所以仍可补回。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:38:#     - 原版在 `g[pt] == bg` 的多色重叠分支里使用启发式 `marker_brackets/min(color)`；那依赖“真正交叉通常已有一个失败者颜色可见”，在本变体下不成立，必须改成按碎片度直接判胜。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:39:#     - 黄射线若穿过隐藏交叉，会把“按碎片度判胜”和“按黄射线强制判胜”两种机制叠在同一格，视觉上不整洁。因此生成器禁止黄射线经过任何真实交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:41:#     - 输入构造时所有交叉格统一留空，且交叉格仍被加入 `blocked`，红/黄标记不能占用或贴邻这些格。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:42:#     - 额外筛掉黄射线经过交叉的候选，避免一个背景交叉同时承载改向语义。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:43:#     - 生成器仍用 `main(inp) == target` 自验证，确保隐藏交叉后的样本可解。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:46:#     - 2-4 个样例里重复出现“空交叉 -> 单色交叉”的现象，人类能直接观察到 D14 的变化。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D11/2/code.py:2:# Dimension: D11 — 交叉结构约束 (meta)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D11/2/code.py:3:# Change: 每个交叉格仅两色重叠，所有线色都必须参与至少一个交叉，交叉处两线必须正交... → 交叉处显示两色混合标记\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D11/2/code.py:132:    Key insight: Grey cells are not choices between two visible colors; they are explicit occlusion markers. The surrounding repaired fragments reveal which color continues straight across horizontally and which color continues straight across vertically, so the solver can rebuild connectivity first and only then repaint the crossing as grey.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/64efde09/D5/3/code.py:33:#   - `_first_marker_on_ray` 依赖 marker 是 outward ray 上第一枚非背景像素；此性质保留，所以只需保证生成器给被标记端口留出无遮挡视线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/64efde09/D5/3/code.py:38:#   - marker 只从“该模板端口在所有 sprite 上到边界均无遮挡”的端口集合里选，避免有些复制射线提前撞上别的 sprite 而看不出新停止线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/64efde09/D5/3/code.py:44:#   - 新 solver 假设 marker 仍在 outward ray 上且唯一；生成器维持唯一 marker 颜色与无遮挡边界对齐。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/581f7754/D4/1/code.py:3:# Change: 边界上的孤立单像素（非角落），4-邻域均为背景色，1-3个不同颜色锚点... → 内部锚点（十字线交叉点）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/581f7754/D4/3/code.py:41:#       It must first recover a border line segment, infer its axis, then compute its target\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/581f7754/D4/3/code.py:89:    - Border anchors are isolated same-color line segments of length 2 or 3 on one edge.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/45a5af55/D9/0/code.py:66:     交叉或不规则形状，因此图面整洁。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D3/1/code.py:31:#     - 原 solver 的 shadow_process 基于连续的 filled_mask 做遮挡；若先打虚线再投影，空隙会错误中断阴影。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7b3084d4/D8/2/code.py:3:# Change: 交叉分割（十字形）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7b80bb43/D9/0/code.py:3:# Change: 每条自由端点的线段从网格边缘延伸，内部连接器（两端都在交叉节点）不受此约束... → 线段不锚定到边缘（浮动线段）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/64efde09/D4/1/code.py:65:#     canvas does not devolve into overlapping cues or ambiguous occlusions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7b80bb43/D2/3/code.py:131:    - One foreground color fg forms axis-aligned line segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/581f7754/D14/0/code.py:55:#     - 保留原题的小型不规则实体和稀疏布局，不引入遮挡层。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7b80bb43/D8/1/code.py:3:# Change: 6-8条轴对齐线段（2-5水平+3-6垂直），形成3-5个4连通分量，含2-3个T型交叉节点... → 十字交叉节点代替T型交叉\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi