uired because a trigger's\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/aa4ec2a5/D15/0/code.py:48:#     - 只减少红色轮廓密度，不增加新颜色和新层级，整体比原题更疏朗，不会引入区域遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8b9c3697/D1/1/code.py:36:#     - 额外干扰红块避开输入与输出的所有非背景区域，避免遮挡结构或轨迹。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D1/2/code.py:150:def _random_occlusion_mask(window: np.ndarray, rng: np.random.Generator) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D1/2/code.py:176:    raise RuntimeError(\"failed to sample a valid occlusion mask\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D1/2/code.py:198:        hidden = _random_occlusion_mask(window, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D2/0/code.py:37:#     - solver must first detect which color is the occlusion mask, then compare\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D2/0/code.py:262:        occlusion = _make_corner_mask(H, W, corner, cut_h, cut_w)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D2/0/code.py:263:        crop[occlusion] = mask_color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D2/3/code.py:3:# Change: 矩形裁剪窗口，行数8-16，列数8-12，面积80-156... → 带遮挡的裁剪窗口\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D2/3/code.py:15:#     - 但裁剪图现在有 3 种颜色：前景色、背景色、遮挡色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D2/3/code.py:16:#     - 遮挡色组成单个轴对齐矩形块，盖住裁剪窗口的一部分像素；其下方真实图案可能同时包含前景/背景两类像素。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D2/3/code.py:19:#     - 变体改成“忽略遮挡块上的像素，只用剩余可见像素做带掩码匹配”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D2/3/code.py:21:#       新 solver 需要先猜哪个颜色是遮挡色，再只比较非遮挡位置上的 0/1 图案。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D2/3/code.py:24:#     - 只新增一个连续遮挡矩形，面积约占窗口的 12%-33%，既能肉眼看见，又不会抹掉过多识别信息。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D2/3/code.py:25:#     - 生成时强制遮挡块同时覆盖两种底层像素，并且两种底层像素在可见区也都保留，使“忽略遮挡”成为必要且可学的规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D2/3/code.py:27:#     - 原 `assert len(colors) == 2` 不再成立，必须扩展为 3 色并枚举遮挡色/前景色角色分配。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/269e22fb/D2/3/code.py:30:#     - 新 solver 隐含假设是“存在唯一的 (遮挡色, 前景色, 背景色,